<title>POLAND: VISCOPLAST RESUMES TRADE WED AFTER FLOOD.</title>
<headline>VISCOPLAST RESUMES TRADE WED AFTER FLOOD.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chemical firm Viscoplast SA, suspended from bourse trade since July 14 due to floods, will resume trade on Wednesday August 13 without the daily 10-percent price-move limit, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
